### Retrieve Current User Information

This endpoint allows you to retrieve the information of the current user.

#### Request

- Method: GET

- URL: `{{Prefix}}/api/users/me`


#### Response

The response will be a JSON object with the following schema:

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "created_at": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "email": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "first_name": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "id": {
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "last_name": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "updated_at": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "username": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  }
}

 ```

### API Request Description

This endpoint allows users to authenticate and obtain an access token by providing their username and password in the request body.

#### Request Body

- `username` (string): The username of the user.

- `password` (string): The password of the user.


### API Response

The response will be in JSON format with the following schema:

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "access_token": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  }
}

 ```

### Retrieve Budget Details

This endpoint retrieves the details of a specific budget.

#### Request

- Method: GET

- URL: `{{Prefix}}/api/budgets/1`


#### Response

The response will be a JSON object with the following schema:

``` json
{
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
        "amount": {
            "type": "number"
        },
        "category": {
            "type": "string"
        },
        "end_date": {
            "type": "string"
        },
        "id": {
            "type": "number"
        },
        "name": {
            "type": "string"
        },
        "remaining_amount": {
            "type": "number"
        },
        "start_date": {
            "type": "string"
        }
    }
}

 ```
